{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "c700697e4999fa0c7a7adb9ffbc3bc66a4b9d575be4f56296c7c8aba8c6cfe92", "ja": "ターメリックなミーティング", "zh": "姜黄色的会议", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6e948c4f27639ed978d6f90bb0310e50199233cafea04bbbdf1c8e14ff537a57", "ja": "ゲーミングカレーについて、ミーティングを\nする事に。様々なアイディアが飛び出すが、\n杏奈には既にゲーミングカレーのイメージが\n掴めている様子。杏奈の主導で、試作品の製\n作が始まった。", "zh": "关于游戏咖喱，决定召开一次会议。各种各样的想法纷纷涌现，不过看样子杏奈已经有了游戏咖喱的概念。在杏奈的主导下，试制品的制作开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "29e5976a40365ef5cb559e7e2070ba4dac2997f08fc4e6d0e92563b02f4a6198", "ja": "（公演の準備と平行して、ゲーミングカレーの企画が\nはじまった。可奈と莉緒も協力してくれるそうだ）", "zh": "（在准备公演的同时，游戏咖喱的企划也开始了。可奈和莉绪似乎也愿意帮忙）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "52ff30416e2d09490ee438c2daa98d2b993a09aac7e650de32c6bfdcd85c2ad5", "ja": "……えっと、指定の期日までに試作品を完成させて、\nレシピを先方に送らないといけないな。あとは……。", "zh": "……那个，必须在指定的日期前完成试吃品，\n把食谱发给对方才行啊。还有就是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "454e20194cb8f4a03bdacb0fd2e59306302c3e1380ba539a641973bb3e82e712", "ja": "おはよう、ございます……。\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "早上好……。\n{$P$}先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f98ff0e4ea65e691d6def5ba5b65d8b4a4fe802f0f058192a52b4f7d3e6319ff", "ja": "おはよう、杏奈。\n集合時間までまだあるけど、今日は早いな？", "zh": "早上好，杏奈。\n离集合时间还早着呢，不过你今天来得真早啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "68e82cce96ded95743597aed50de08c880dd176bb461c9ca93dc1e2b94635955", "ja": "ん。ゲーミングカレーの、ミーティングだから……。\nなんだか落ち着かなくて……早めに、来た……ふわぁ。", "zh": "嗯。因为要开电竞咖喱的会……\n总觉得定不下心来……就早点，过来了……哈欠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "d311ec7833c95591ac89a9c40a2a7eeb47ced40d40d98ade6349b96bd38a2d27", "ja": "ネットで、いっぱいカレーのこと……調べてたら……\n朝になってて……ちょっと、寝不足……ふわぁ……。", "zh": "在网上查了好多关于咖喱的资料……结果就天亮了……有点睡眠不足……哈啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b0123e72ffcc4e1b83179cc06821f95637bac3db330f1ef2d2602ad6af35cbab", "ja": "（杏奈がゲーム以外で夜更かしを……？\nいや、よく考えたらこれもゲーム関係か）", "zh": "（杏奈居然会为了游戏以外的事熬夜……？不对，仔细想想，这还是和游戏有关吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "6eb79545d39084fdc4530a8827726ea01bf77366aa8011c16319fd1cfd4ff6d0", "ja": "{$P$}さん……どうしたの……？\n杏奈……なにか変、だった……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……怎么了……？\n杏奈……是不是……有点奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "522f013699722b38634b7a2a93dc04232f53197411025901e11d9aebcebdfae5", "ja": "いや、ありがたいなと思ってな。\nそれで調べてみて、何か進展はあったか？", "zh": "没有，我只是觉得很感激。\n那么查了之后，有什么进展吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "45b9999831bba410d14263b7964f7ca7c4cab12cd07017e23e08243db90df887", "ja": "んと……方向性は、なんとなく決まった、かも……。\nあとは……作ってみて、調整です……。", "zh": "唔……大致的方向……可能算定下来了……\n剩下的……就是实际做做看，再调整了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "a98cee54564fb7697a4359502c273596887d305b1441269519895cf76d0f20ac", "ja": "おはようございまーす、{$P$}さん！\nはれっ！？　杏奈ちゃん、もう来てる！", "zh": "早上好——，{$P$}先生！\n咦！？杏奈已经到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "0cc2d0af49d0d8930be9edd67b7757637a47b4a38fc4a268ade8a4f7e7b18830", "ja": "あら、{$P$}くんも。\nみんな早いのね。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}君也在。\n大家来得都挺早呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3287b438c569db58472de4a8a9b38ef1ab0ec7da6ad2fdfc97029863ca18ea66", "ja": "お疲れさま、可奈、莉緒。\n集合時間より前に、みんな揃っちゃったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，可奈、莉绪。  \n大家在集合时间之前就已经到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "99d69117d9427c4af87feeeafd2458781650af564fe27661e1e7afe2f0710a96", "ja": "実は、カレー作りの役に立ちそうなモノを見つけたの！\n杏奈ちゃんに見せたくて、早く来ちゃった♪", "zh": "其实，我发现了一个感觉做咖喱能派上用场的东西！\n因为想快点给杏奈看，就早早跑过来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "6e56bcabffbb2d9781c932b91f6d95105c36cc695546919819f996d83dec0cba", "ja": "わあ、莉緒さんさすが！　私なんて、\nカレーが楽しみってだけで早くきちゃったのに……。", "zh": "哇，莉绪小姐真厉害！我都只是\n因为期待吃咖喱，才早早跑过来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "94462cc8b339909d0f37e90bc2dc08833a06aef96293bda436b19330037b8081", "ja": "あら、いいのよ可奈ちゃん。\nせっかくのお仕事なんだもの、楽しまなくちゃ♪", "zh": "哎呀，没关系啦，可奈。难得有这样的工作，当然要好好享受才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5c29991ee0f9df38a897f202dc8571cc44fa1fcbacb40fb6af55a245a1a3b3dd", "ja": "それで、莉緒は何を持ってきたんだ？", "zh": "那么，莉绪带了什么来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "499284736ade501bc927c74f3fb67837eefa0569e05d1e2e3c986c3a88e63271", "ja": "いい質問よ、{$P$}くん！\n私が持ってきたのはコレ！　『スパークドリンク』！", "zh": "问得好，{$P$}！\n我带来的就是这个！“能量饮料”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "dd63b51b74d421db61170c5506eab6e8cbd0a7dfc0a4ccedcd6df0016c43240c", "ja": "店頭で『ゲームにピッタリ♪』って書いてあったの。\n見た瞬間、これに決めちゃった！", "zh": "店头写着“游戏时的绝配♪”。\n我一眼看到，就决定是它了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9c1ec42374720bb1d184393af4bf77d0e4743e1ab0b36bf28a4d54b85f840806", "ja": "『スパークドリンク』……エネルギー飲料だな。\n……どうやって使うんだ？", "zh": "“火花饮料”……是能量饮料啊。\n……要怎么用？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "04d90d44d862938663261cb343586efed73653fee38228c8c59a83e20cffc450", "ja": "それはもちろん、カレーに混ぜるのよ！\nどんな味になるかは、わからないけど……あはは。", "zh": "当然是要混进咖喱里啦！\n虽然不知道会变成什么味道……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "3c1f36f015a2d868f18e1c04d70a97174adc7f41b4addafe0d2872deb2e159ba", "ja": "莉緒さん……？", "zh": "莉緒小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "36bd46263c531d87fa85b025a67c9ac513a772f72a930f4a9655f651bc4e6b0c", "ja": "莉緒、冗談だよな？", "zh": "莉绪，你是在开玩笑吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "95c1eb7fe06c2d700ec011f1a760f52038ee6b498487f985802e372fa370d459", "ja": "……それ、いい。", "zh": "……那个，挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "7aa62811ca8374b45532df3ae360ff1bc47791c2eaaba38f84f88cddd9b06bd3", "ja": "ええっ！？　杏奈ちゃーん！？", "zh": "诶诶！？杏奈——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "dff1ac2697f8268665d5685bced7a44a5cfa3f0ddd52f43556b502b01c262cf6", "ja": "じょ、冗談だよな……杏奈？", "zh": "这、这只是开玩笑吧……杏奈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "dc5ade66835f7eb63c7681f452388293de221b68f17a8a16d43c3c5a3824b5a8", "ja": "あら、お気に召してもらえた？　よかった！\n念のため多めに買ってきたけど、どれくらい使うの？", "zh": "哎呀，你喜欢吗？太好啦！\n以防万一我多买了些，要用多少呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1027_024ann", "source_sha256": "4be0d8d3fd8b14557fa365946a1081bc936a7e6c993095de7f4521708bfec6e5", "ja": "ううん。カレーには……入れない、かな……。\nエナドリは……杏奈が、飲みたいだけ……。", "zh": "不是。咖喱里……不放这个，吧……\n能量饮料……只是杏奈自己想喝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1028_036kan", "source_sha256": "8c06061c92d3888b05b490d79ff866652ebf62366801d863e30c3f082f51844f", "ja": "あ、そうなんだ……じゃあ、杏奈ちゃん。\nゲーミングカレーは、どんな材料で作るの？", "zh": "啊，原来是这样……那么，杏奈。\n制作电竞咖喱要用什么材料呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "bdaafe14cb2456593bf776f440e116196685e8e4b9dfad8428d30cd0db811b44", "ja": "んとね、考えてるのは……たまねぎと、じゃがいも……\nあとは、コンソメ……とか。", "zh": "那个呢，我在想的是……洋葱，还有土豆……\n再就是，清汤块……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "09119564eed05034ede2ae4646274eb1bddc26dc11e3688a6029d867a3a2ba6d", "ja": "あれ？　おうちで作るカレーって感じだね。\nお腹が空いてきちゃうな～。", "zh": "咦？感觉很像在家里做的咖喱呢。\n肚子都要变饿了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "06c8563d5eee940bafeaeeccd7e3b92b1392d9cd51368455d2c5656e49d2c45c", "ja": "うん……ゲーミングカレーに、\n珍しい材料は、必要ないと思う……。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得做游戏咖喱，不需要什么稀奇的材料……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "b99e20cb1ac727d88a871c277d7b462b3778343c06d6dcb0d765ebe66664118b", "ja": "もっと、ゲームが楽しくなるカレー……。\nそんなカレーに、したいなって……。", "zh": "能让人玩游戏变得更开心的咖喱……\n我想做成，那样的咖喱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0162_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_02_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "e6fd37560667f01cdb9d6ec8af5c58d83f3dd51c45f996cce28224e3cf780db9", "ja": "ゲームが楽しくなるカレー？　わあ、いいね！\nみんながニコニコできそうなカレー♪", "zh": "能让游戏变得更有趣的咖喱？哇，好棒！\n感觉是能让大家都笑容满面的咖喱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
